          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छीनना — chīnnā — \"to snatch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उसने मीरा के हाथ से मोबाइल छीन लिया। usne Mīrā ke hāth se mobāil chīn liyā. He snatched the mobile phone out of Mira's hand."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने थैला छीना, usne thailā chīnā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छीनना (chīnnā) is set by CDIAL under Sanskrit chinna, \"cut off\" (CDIAL 5047): what is snatched is torn away from its owner. It often takes लेना: छीन लिया, snatched it away."
            }
          ]
        },
