          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झपटना — jhapaṭnā — \"to lunge; to swoop\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चोर मेरे थैले पर झपटा और भाग गया। cor mere thaile par jhapṭā aur bhāg gayā. The thief lunged at my bag and ran off."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): वह थैले पर झपटा, vah thaile par jhapṭā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झपटना (jhapaṭnā) comes from jhapp, a sudden movement, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 5336). A hawk झपटता है on its prey; a thief झपटता है on a bag: थैले पर झपटा."
            }
          ]
        },
