              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पीछा — pīchā — \"a chase; the pursuit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर मेरे पास साइकिल होती तो मैं चोर का पीछा करता। agar mere pās sāikil hotī to maiṁ cor kā pīchā kartā. If I had had a bicycle, I would have gone after the thief."
            },
