              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पीछा (pīchā) is the noun behind पीछे, behind, from paśca, the back part, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 7990). किसी का पीछा करना is to go after someone: to make yourself the one behind them."
            }
          ]
        },
